OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMist and fog patches will
OL,6,Fgradually lift to allow some bright
OL,7,Fspells to develop for a while.
OL,8,FHowever, a weather front will feed
OL,9,Fthicker cloud and some drizzle
OL,10,Fsoutheastwards across the country as
OL,11,Fthe day unfolds. Staying quite mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe evening will see rather
OL,14,Fcloudy skies and the odd spot of
OL,15,Fdrizzle. However, clear spells will
OL,16,Fdevelop from the north overnight.
OL,17,FMostly frost-free, with fairly gentle
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
