OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMonday promises to be a fine
OL,6,Fday with early mist soon clearing to
OL,7,Fgive some sunny periods. Perhaps a
OL,8,Flittle more cloud developing later.
OL,9,FTemperatures nearer average, and
OL,10,Fbecoming breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FLots
OL,13,Fof dry weather is expected through the
OL,14,Fperiod, with bright or sunny spells.
OL,15,FHowever, areas of cloud will arrive
OL,16,Ffrom the east as winds freshen,
OL,17,Fbringing the odd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
